# The return ability's cost is {2} and "Sacrifice an artifact or creature". On turn 3 Bot1 has only two untapped Swamps (the
# Lotus Petal that helped cast Gollum was sacrificed), so the ability is not offered: lands are neither. Once it casts an
# Ornithopter (a creature, and an artifact) the same ability is offered, and Bot1 sacrifices the Ornithopter to pay
# for it and gets Gollum back.

