Swamp
Lotus Petal
Gollum the Abandoned
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Dismember
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

